<para>Attempt to consume one token from the bucket. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Performs a refill pass for elapsed time, then tries an atomic compare-exchange decrement. Never blocks.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>true A token was successfully consumed; the caller may proceed. </para>
</simplesect>
